/// \mainpage Experimentation System
///
/// \section structure Structure
/// - `ExperimentLauncher` calls `ExperimentConfigHandler`
/// - `ExperimentConfigHandler` expands the fork trees and validates configs
/// - `DatasetHandler` loads and processes datasets
/// - `Trainer` runs training given a config and logs results
/// - `ClassifierModelLoader` builds models from config
/// - `ClassifierDataset` wraps processed data for PyTorch
/// - `ExplainabilityModule` and `ModelExplainability` provide model interpretation
///
/// \section components Main Components
/// - **ExperimentLauncher**: Orchestrates the experiment, calling config, dataset, and training modules.
/// - **ExperimentConfigHandler**: Expands configuration forks, merges configs, and manages sweep/final evaluation configs.
/// - **DatasetHandler**: Loads raw data, builds processed datasets, and prepares classifier-ready data.
/// - **RawDataset**: Container for raw protein data (IDs, labels, sequences, metrics).
/// - **ProcessedDataset**: Handles feature processing, embedding loading, and dataset construction.
/// - **ClassifierDataset**: PyTorch Dataset for processed features and labels.
/// - **TrainerModule**: Runs training and cross-validation, logs metrics.
/// - **ClassifierModelLoader**: Instantiates models from config.
/// - **ExplainabilityModule** / **ModelExplainability**: Provides SHAP, Integrated Gradients, and GradCAM explanations.
///
/// \section flow Experiment Flow
/// 1. **ExperimentLauncher** initializes and coordinates the experiment.
/// 2. **ExperimentConfigHandler** expands and validates all configuration forks.
/// 3. **DatasetHandler** loads and processes the dataset, including embeddings.
/// 4. **TrainerModule** trains the model using the processed data.
/// 5. **ClassifierModelLoader** builds the model as specified in the config.
/// 6. **ClassifierDataset** wraps the processed data for PyTorch training.
/// 7. **ExplainabilityModule** and **ModelExplainability** provide model interpretation and feature importance.
///
/// \section diagram Class/Module Relationships
///
/// \dot
/// digraph experiment_flow {
///     ExperimentLauncher -> ExperimentConfigHandler;
///     ExperimentLauncher -> DatasetHandler;
///     ExperimentLauncher -> TrainerModule;
///     ExperimentConfigHandler -> DatasetHandler;
///     DatasetHandler -> RawDataset;
///     DatasetHandler -> ProcessedDataset;
///     DatasetHandler -> ClassifierDataset;
///     TrainerModule -> ClassifierModelLoader;
///     TrainerModule -> ClassifierDataset;
///     TrainerModule -> ExplainabilityModule;
///     ExplainabilityModule -> ModelExplainability;
/// }
/// \enddot
///
/// \section explainability Explainability
/// - `ExplainabilityModule` and `ModelExplainability` support SHAP, Integrated Gradients, and GradCAM for model interpretation.
///